3) independent review of 205f293: round-2 findings re-run and confirmed closed; new: buffer-sync regression (shape mismatch aborted gloo with SIGABRT), OOM while preparing without rescue, CUDA-located RNG/generator states, effective AMP mode not agreed -> closed in 0e86c52 (119/119)

